** =====================================================================
**  SHEAR LOCKING TEST - slender cantilever, plane strain, tip shear load
**  L = 100 mm, h = 10 mm, unit thickness, E = 210000 MPa, nu = 0.3
**  Total tip load P = 100 N downward (split over the end nodes)
**  Mesh: 10 x 1 elements.  Element type: CPE4R
**
**  Reference tip deflection: 1.74 mm (fine quadratic mesh; Timoshenko
**  beam theory with plane-strain modulus gives 1.748 mm).
**
**  Experiments: (1) change CPE4 <-> CPE4R and compare the tip deflection
**              (2) regenerate finer meshes with make_beam_decks.py
** =====================================================================
**
